<title>USA: U.S. Diagnostic Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>U.S. Diagnostic Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	 Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			    Sept. 30,		   Sept. 30,</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
